  "generated_description": "<div class=\"mountain-description prose prose-stone max-w-none\">\n  <p>At 13,064 feet, <strong>Wheeler Peak</strong> is a summit in Nevada. It has roughly 7,546 feet of topographic prominence. The Wheeler Peak Trail is a 4.0-mile hike with about 2,753 feet of elevation gain. Nearby peaks include Doso Doyabi, Mount Moriah and Mount Grafton. Trail data is sourced from OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL); verify current conditions with the official land manager before you go.</p>\n</div>",
